  "notes": "{酒|さけ} means both Japanese sake (rice wine) and alcohol in general.\n\nTYPES OF ALCOHOL:\n- {日本酒|にほんしゅ}: Japanese sake (rice wine)\n- {焼酎|しょうちゅう}: shochu (distilled spirit)\n- {梅酒|うめしゅ}: plum wine\n- {洋酒|ようしゅ}: Western liquor\n- ビール: beer\n\nSAKE SERVING STYLES:\n- {熱燗|あつかん}: hot sake\n- {冷|ひ}や: room temperature sake\n- {冷酒|れいしゅ}: chilled sake\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {酒|さけ}を{飲|の}む: to drink alcohol\n- {酒|さけ}に{強|つよ}い: can hold one's liquor\n- {酒|さけ}に{弱|よわ}い: can't hold one's liquor\n- {居酒屋|いざかや}: izakaya (Japanese pub)",
